🚀 New-Hire Onboarding Concierge(ORBIT_V4)
FastAPI  |  SQLite  |  JWT Authentication


📌 Overview
A professional AI-powered employee onboarding management system with orchestrator agent coordination and real-time progress tracking.


✨ Features
🧠 Orchestrator Agent – Rule-based workflow coordinator with 8 sequential tasks
📊 Real-time Tracking – Live dashboard updates (2–5 sec auto-refresh)
👥 Dual Roles – Separate HR and Manager interfaces
🔁 Retry Management – Managers can retry failed tasks (max 3 attempts)
📝 Full Logging – All actions tracked with history
🎨 Enterprise UI – Professional blue theme
🔐 JWT Authentication – Secure token-based access
💾 SQLite DB – Lightweight persistent storage




🔄 Workflow Flows
Onboarding Sequence Flow
HR Login → Create Employee → Trigger Orchestrator
↓  Task 1: Account Creation
↓  Task 2: IT Asset Setup
↓  Task 3: HR Document Signing
↓  Task 4: Manager Introduction
↓  Task 5: Workspace Assignment
↓  Task 6: Training Enrollment
↓  Task 7: Policy Acknowledgment
↓  Task 8: Welcome Kit Dispatch
↓  ✅ Onboarding Complete

Task Execution & Retry Flow
Task Start → In Progress → Success? → YES → Next Task
                                 ↓ NO
                           Mark Failed → Notify Manager
                      Manager Clicks Retry → Reset to Pending
                         Re-execute → Back to Success?

User Role Flow
HR Role
Manager Role
Create Employee
View Team
View All Tasks
Monitor Tasks
Full Log Access
Retry Failed Tasks
Delete Employee
View Task Details





💾 Database Schema (4 Tables)
Table
Key Fields
Users
id, username, password, role, created_at
Employees
id, user_id(FK), name, email, department, status, created_at
Tasks
id, employee_id(FK), task_name, status, retry_count, executed_at, error_msg
Logs
id, employee_id(FK), action, timestamp, user_role





📋 Onboarding Tasks (8 Steps)
Account Creation – Create user accounts (HR)
IT Asset Setup – Configure laptop/software (IT)
HR Document Signing – Complete contracts (HR)
Manager Introduction – Meet team lead (Manager)
Workspace Assignment – Assign desk/access (Facilities)
Training Enrollment – Register for courses (HR)
Policy Acknowledgment – Sign policies (HR)
Welcome Kit Dispatch – Send swag bag (HR)

Status Flow: Pending → In Progress → Completed
Failure Flow: Failed → Retry (max 3) → Pending → In Progress → Completed




🛠️ Tech Stack
Backend
Python 3.9+
FastAPI
SQLite
JWT
Uvicorn

Frontend
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript ES6
Fetch API
setInterval (2–5 sec polling)




🚀 Installation
git clone https://github.com/shansree-z/Orbit_V4.git
cd Orbit_V4
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate      # Windows
source venv/bin/activate   # Mac/Linux
pip install -r requirements.txt
python init_db.py
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

Docker Alternative
docker build -t orbit-v4 .
docker run -p 8000:8000 orbit-v4




📖 Usage
Access URLs
HR Dashboard → http://localhost:8000
Manager Dashboard → http://localhost:8000/manager
API Docs → http://localhost:8000/docs

